{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "a344085a7cd4e67d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to the priests. And I will have to suffer because of my marriage and my own choice, and he will cut off your head with an axe."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "cf0436eafd01376c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Moreover, you speak to me here on earth, before the doors of my room, yet you promise to bring me a bridegroom from heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4fdc5f77843359b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What heavenly being desires marriage? All heavenly beings are spirits without bodies. And the angel answered:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "f959e3197859b585",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“For the sake of those with bodies and those without bodies, he will be called the Son of the Most High.” The virgin said, “Where, then, will he have a father,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "fbba2ac0b4ac60ab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the one who, as you say, is to be born from me?” And the angel answered, “This is the wonder for you: you do not know a man,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "aa54b0bc6ef3a190",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "yet you will give birth to the one of whom I speak, and the child will not be fatherless."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "d6593e95bc2d7c5a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will come out of your womb without damaging its doors, and you will not lose your virginity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "8515f3f1f572df8d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You will nurse the one who is born, and you will acknowledge as God the one born from you. You will carry the infant in your arms,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "13ff97822e886bb7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and you will see him upon the cherubim. For to this one born from you, O virgin,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "895d2934f676ae8d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the Lord God will give the throne of his father David, and his kingdom will have no end.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "069d9cab8205b7d2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The virgin answered, “Without meaning to, you too have gone astray in speaking. Your own mouth has accused you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "778cd6bf9e42735d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your own lips have become evidence against you. Just now you said,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "d180dd09363724bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "‘The one who is born will be called the Son of the Most High,’ but now you say, ‘the son of David.’ What does this mean?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "0583af7676b05d2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Whenever you wish, you lift my mind up to heaven, and whenever you wish, you bring it down to earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "eb2986d128082a5d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Which statement am I to believe, the first or the second?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "642abb5596a341e0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For you say that the Lord God will give him the throne of his father David,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "f06f132659c37730",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and his kingdom will have no end. None of the kings was free from death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "16578a4311c6cce8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "No one escaped the end common to all. The immortal Master takes them all away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "ba9bee76dc4b4025",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Worms devour them all. None of the kings escaped the gates of Hades."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "e07f0d7fa67f3920",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "No one leaped over its snares; no one escaped its nets. Neither Saul, the first to establish the royal crown,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "dd52f87dbb7e07a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor David, who through the horn was revealed and declared worthy of kingship,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "0df877a7c8ec48a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor Samuel, the father of kings, who through olive oil recognized the unworthy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "ba5c6e1572b7b6b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor Solomon the wise, who exposed a slanderous lie with a sword,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "1744a5197971d390",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor Hezekiah, who through tears reversed the decree of death. How, then, will my son reign forever?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "d12427d41e6a2c04",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the angel answered, “This, Mary, is the wonder and the mystery for you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "020408ba9c584b66",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For everyone has died, but your son will conquer death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.119v.s15",
      "source_sha256": "b5011ce0bc4d1210",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will raise the dead, open the tombs, and shatter the keys of Hades."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "05137789ded32d88",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will raise many bodies of those who have died. For, being born of the immortal one, he will put death to death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "1bfdc2bbc4c0ba16",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not disbelieve, lest you fall into guilt. For he of whom I speak has already leaped into your womb through your hearing,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "cf2d3bce26065552",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "renewing your womb. And the virgin said, “So that I may believe you about him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "8a59626c2c55f9b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "first explain to me how he is both the Son of the Most High and the son of David—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "50a0408b49fe717c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he who, as you say, is to be born of me on earth, and whom you claim will be without a father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "73d56f82a51d0f7e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How, then, have you named two fathers?” And the angel said, “First learn, and then dispute. When I say ‘Son of the Most High,’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "8db1e7ad958d2249",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I indicate the Father who begot him before the ages, without passion. When I say ‘son of David,’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "0477096b264e5def",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I say this because you descend from your forefather David. Accept the word of my message with certainty and keep it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "219e100f0011f50e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For I too am a servant of him whom you are to see working within you as God.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "dff18a7e0b01444d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the angel sent to her, having spoken in this way, left her. And Mary pondered within herself:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "9ec9ddf406a90a5f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Shall I tell Joseph this? Or shall I rather conceal this secret? What if the one who came has lied?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "eb26c753c56ef633",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why should I provoke the old man’s tongue to anger?” And while she was uncertain about this, her womb was swelling,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "93604ed05060b225",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the child was moving within. Mary did not know what to do. She piled many garments over her womb,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "00f466d792af0648",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "wanting to spare Joseph. But she could not hide a city standing on a hilltop. The sight of her womb struck Joseph,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "c223f1e9e7bc971d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and, looking up from below, he examined the virgin’s womb. He wanted to question her,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4568bf4df4e53a0c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but he was compelled to remain silent. And he wanted to conceal her, as one who had sold the vessel of her virginity [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "7be58a2d1c6db560",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yet her former way of life held him back, so that now he tormented his soul with sorrow."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "bea2538924a0fe0c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Oh, woe is me!” he said. “What shall I do? Her face is a virgin’s, her walk is a virgin’s, her eyes are a virgin’s,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "cdd7a7e0c2e6d9cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "her smile is a virgin’s, her speech is a virgin’s, but her womb is not a virgin’s, but a mother’s."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "403fa6617f970ef1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I cannot bear it. Shall I reveal the matter? But if I expose Mary, the shame will be shared."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "d3ad9cb8eb04e9d0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Shall I raise my voice and cry out? For I am afraid that I might become the accuser of a child conceived without seed. No one is the child’s accuser,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "e318990228beee02",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "since the one being born has no one who sowed him. In every way, both speaking and remaining silent bring me trouble."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "6a0212956176385c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What, then, shall I do? Shall I call her and question her? Or shall I expose her before questioning her?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "0b3844d5eda1d564",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But Scripture bears witness, saying, “Reprove, but do not act.” Calling her with an angry face,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "8bcc79ba98413ea4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he judged the one who was in her womb. The judge sat and said, “Tell me, Mary,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.120v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "6374902b1b86ed41",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "what has happened? Do not hide from me what has befallen you. There is no one here listening to this conversation. I know how to keep"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "ef1602187b34aad2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a secret. No one shall hear of this. Tell me alone: where has this come from?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "8dee6ddaeca145a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Show me this child's father, so that I may forgive your sin. For you will deserve mercy, as a woman overcome by her thoughts.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "21e3676a93d9d3ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then the pure virgin Mary said, weeping, “If you are looking for this child's father, you will find him nowhere."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "84eaf577ae67de2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And if you think him an orphan, that does not apply to him either.” Joseph said, “Mary, you cannot even lie!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "0fcacfc8903ff804",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For how can he neither be an orphan nor have a father?” Mary said, “If I tell you the truth, you will not believe me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "0a6c8c30b3a537a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You look at my womb, but you do not see the one hidden within it. You examine my belly, but you do not consider"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "f54e41eca0cc0ff5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that the one born of the Father, from the womb before the morning star, is dwelling there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "4dea48f629dcb441",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If I tell you what the angel said, you will say, ‘You are making yourself your own witness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "b967e43294a5a991",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Your testimony is not true. Bring someone who heard, or someone who stood there. Bring trustworthy witnesses.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "3692441611592246",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you seek this, you will never find it. For one was sent by one to one woman,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "577df5c23841e17b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and for the sake of the one to be born, he spoke to her alone. There was no one else. If anyone had been there,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "1f9449e0dfe0ebcd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he would surely have wanted to be the father of the child to be born.” And when he did not believe the virgin, realizing this,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "91122cbfd6751b0d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the woman Mary turned to another thought and said, even against her will, “Since I am so utterly mistrusted,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "046c08c597a2fbc5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and truly my womb betrays me, and the child exposes me as he leaps within my womb,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "9b2de5029f149f04",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "why do I myself anger Joseph still more? Let me shut off my reply with silence; let me bind my lips with silence"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "db4556f75952186d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and plead unseen with the angel. Where are you now, you who said to me, ‘Rejoice’?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "777ea0cca70f002d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Tell me where you dwell, so that I may go there and cling to your neck"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "7ba0ee617cca31b3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "until you come and make it clear to Joseph whose Son this is who plays upon the bed of my womb."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "2c686c49366b0401",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I cannot bear to see the old man lamenting under this burden, and I do not know where you are delaying."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "d4f1ee3a6b988f05",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Come and plead my case.” While Mary was saying these things, the angel quickly came to Joseph"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "d873fd342bea81d6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and, making the matter clear, stopped him from driving out the virgin. “Do not be afraid, Joseph, to take your wife, who is not joined to you in marriage,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "b1bfc9a068143d05",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but appointed to serve God's mysteries. I call her your wife, but you are not the father.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "9c0bb15f8307ba7d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "Do not seek a father on earth or a mother in heaven. For his nature is entirely free from orphanhood."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "95a6536f436aff47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "For he alone was born of the one, once before the ages, and again, he alone of her alone,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.121v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "db501f37427fccb5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "is born as he alone knows. Do not trouble Mary. Do not make what comes from Mary a cause of grief. Do not ask how, lest you be harmed by"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "d6068d4c62670eeb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "the light. Do not disturb the ark, lest you [?] what is in it. A vessel without blemish, a dwelling without defilement,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "bcad4d5a08c207ef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "a glass vessel undisturbed, a birth without seed, a virgin without marriage,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "1fee7f68d5c2b743",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "a pure woman without a bridal chamber, a stone not cut out, a locked city, a sealed spring,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "ab159f29862a6cd0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "an unsown field, an unplanted vine, an indescribable wonder, an incomprehensible birth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "85ad715822cade36",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "But if you do not believe what I am telling you, wait for the time of the birth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "4a25fdd0849b6f22",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "Then, if Mary groans or cries out like other women, he is a man and not God in the flesh,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "fa60e8f03787fcae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "who is being born of Mary. And Joseph answered, “If what you say is so, O angel,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "8431156b751d1868",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "why did the nations rage, and the peoples meditate on vain things?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a7de73a581a5388b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "And the angel said, “If you wish to learn, learn quickly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "347af07a127cbfc0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "For the Lord said to the one being born, ‘You are my Son; today I have begotten you.’ For to him belong glory and power,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/chrysostom-in-annuntiationem-1#Supr.122r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "0c75e906eba10bae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "honor and worship, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
